  "comment": "Single source of HMI colours. tools/build_theme.py generates the C palette and the web token block from this file. Values: #rrggbb, or rgba(r,g,b,a) for a colour with its own opacity. Every theme defines every token. Every theme must meet the contrast pairs (WCAG ratio, opaque colours).",
